{"id":"weste","lemma":"Weste","pos":"noun","rank":3775,"glosses":["waistcoat, vest (usually sleeveless garment worn over a shirt)"],"ipa":"/ˈvɛstə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ad/De-at-Weste.ogg/De-at-Weste.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Weste","plural":"Westen"},"examples":[{"text":"Er hat noch immer eine weiße Weste.","en":"He still has a white vest.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"at all times without…"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"one of a variety of…"},null]},{"text":"Tom trug eine kugelsichere Weste.","en":"Tom was wearing a bulletproof vest.","words":[null,{"g":"to carry, to bear","l":"tragen"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"bulletproof","l":"kugelsicher"},null]},{"text":"Wir gehen nach Westen.","en":"We're going west.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566151","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to go, to walk"},{"g":"after / to"},null]},{"text":"Tom zog seine kugelsichere Weste aus.","en":"Tom took off his bullet-proof vest.","words":[null,{"g":"to pull","l":"ziehen"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},{"g":"bulletproof","l":"kugelsicher"},null,{"g":"out of / from"}]},{"text":"Die Sonne geht im Westen unter.","en":"The sun sets in the west.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"a sun"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"in the"},null,{"g":"under"}]}]}